  "label": "Holocaust Denial/Minimization",
  "description": "The act of denying, downplaying, or trivializing the Holocaust and its atrocities. The text overlay in the image, which states 'the horrors of the holocaust', is a direct counter to such denial. Understanding this concept is necessary to recognize that the image is meant to convey the gravity of the event, not to be dismissed or minimized.",
